    "title": "Man who used ChatGPT to plan Omaha bank robbery sentenced - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Bell ,\n7 hours ago OMAHA, Neb. (WOWT) - The man accused in federal court of robbing a bank after using an AI program to help with planning has been sentenced. 23-year-old Deron Lewis-Payne was charged with bank robbery and using, carrying, and brandishing a firearm during a crime of violence. He was sentenced Aug. 13 to 10 years and a month in prison. Read full article\n1",
